From b98d9fd836c79575193a02145ef2d86137025a0f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: omesh <roland@nordhain.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Apr 2026 13:07:10 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 01/41] feat: full wallet-compatible RPC + increased sync
 limits
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Enable all bin RPC handlers (getblocks.bin, gethashes.bin, get_outs.bin, etc.)
- Enable JSON-RPC handlers (get_info, get_version)
- Enable other JSON handlers (get_transactions, is_key_image_spent, etc.)
- Implement HardForkInfo, FeeEstimate, AltChains in context task
- Fix todo!() panics in database_size, alt_chain_count, txpool size
- Increase block batch limits (1000→10000, 1MB→20MB)
- Full txpool read service implementation

Monero GUI/CLI wallet can now connect and sync against this node.

Author: Roland Kohlhuber
